<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Merchant up on retail buying.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Merchant up on retail buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merchant Bank of Sri Lanka Ltd rose five percent, or one rupee to 21 on a small volume of 600 shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Retailers who took profit when the share peaked at about 25 rupees, are getting back in,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>The scrip, which is cheap and liquid, is favoured by small investors, he said.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
